WEll, This is Space Empire which I converted it from the Atari ST BBS's.
From now on I will use  SE for the name.  It is another one of those Empire
type games.  If you have played Master's Empire you know what I'm talking
about.  The big difference is the setting, SE setting is in Space.  There are
over 20 different options which can be perform in the game. Also when in the 
buying stage there are different type of fighters, cruisers and other
equipment.  I could go on talking about the game for a couple of pages but
that is what the documentation is there for.  By the way if you haven't
played Master's Empire and your a Sysop you need to get it.   Call

